{title: Governor Over That Land}
{subtitle: 1 Kings 4:19; 4:7–19}
{key: Dm}
{tempo: 84}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Dm] | ×8

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Solomon had twelve district [C]governors o[Bb]ver [C]all Is[Dm]rael
Who supplied provisions for [C]the king and his household
Each [Bb]one was re[C]sponsible for [Bb]one month of the year
In the [Dm]hill country of [C]Ephraim Ben-Hur [Dm]stood
Ben-Dek-er in Makaz and [C]Shaalbim
Ben-[Bb]H-esed in A[C]rubboth and the [Dm]land of Hepher
Ben-A-bi-na-dab in all of [C]Naphath Dor
Baana [Bb]son of A[C]hilud in [Bb]Taanach and Me[Dm]giddo
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Geber son [C]of Uri in the [Bb]land of Gi[Dm]lead
The country of [C]Sihon king of [Bb]the Amo[Dm]rites
And of Og king of [C]Bashan
He was the [Bb]one governor over that [Dm]land
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [Dm] | [C] | [Bb] | [C] [Dm] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Dm]Ben-Ge-ber in Ramoth Gilead with [C]Jair's settlements
The [Bb]region of Ar[C]gob in [Dm]Bashan sixty large cities
With walls and bronze bars [C]on their gates
A[Bb]hinadab son of [C]Iddo [Bb]in Maha[Dm]naim
Ahimaaz in Naphtali married [C]a daughter of Solomon
[Bb]Baana son of [C]Hushai in [Dm]Asher and Bealoth
Jehoshafat son of Paru[C]ah in Issachar
[Bb]Shimei son of E[C]la [Bb]in [Dm]Benjamin
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Geber son [C]of Uri in the [Bb]land of Gi[Dm]lead
The country of Si[C]hon king of [Bb]the Amo[Dm]rites
And of Og king of [C]Bashan
He was the [Bb]one governor over that [Dm]land
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [Dm] | [C] | [Bb] | [C] [Dm] | ×2

